<item><title>Mozambican health official Samo Gudo elected to lead 112-country public health body</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambican-health-official-samo-gudo-elected-to-lead-112-72e43f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambican-health-official-samo-gudo-elected-to-lead-112-72e43f/</guid><category>Mozambique</category><description>Gudo, director of the National Institute of Health, becomes the first African to hold the presidency of the International Association of National Public Health Institutes.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:20:44 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" length="36290" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
